# app/web-next/.env.sample — Prisma CLI tooling values ONLY
# (design docs/designs/2026-11-13-env-single-source-design.md).
#
# prisma.config.ts reads DATABASE_URL from THIS file: Prisma 7's CLI does not
# auto-load .env for the config module itself. There is no PrismaClient at
# runtime — the runtime DB handle is bun:sqlite in db/client.ts.
#
# ALL co-newbiz runtime configuration (LLM block, web-search keys/flags,
# executor agent modes, CO_NEWBIZ_DB_PATH, scheduler NOTIFY keys) lives in the
# repo-root .env — the SSOT; see the root .env.sample for the full annotated
# list. Do NOT re-add runtime keys here: the Next.js auto-load of this file
# would shadow the root value (the root-env loader warns at boot), and
# scripts/co-newbiz/env-check.ts fails on a key defined in both files with
# different values.

# Prisma CLI datasource (prisma.config.ts); Prisma 7 sqlite URIs need the file: prefix.
DATABASE_URL=
